}

## record_srd_planar_patron
Record a cosmic patron known to this caster and its actual loyal creatures (GM fiction).
arguments: {
 // Exact state entity ID for caster_state from SYLVIA_GM_CAMPAIGN_PREPARATION or SYLVIA_GM_FRESH_CAMPAIGN_STATE; never use a display name.
